#. ja: 幻想生物創造場への到達
#. de: Die Phantomologie erreichen
#. fr: Atteindre le département de phantasmagénie
msgctxt "InstanceContentTextData:21704:0:0"
msgid "Arrive in Phantomology"
msgstr "Доберитесь до отдела фантомологии"

#. ja: 我が生命を捧げ、強く気高き創造物を……！<br>獣を鎮める力をここに……ケツァクウァトル！
#. de: Ich werde die Richtigkeit von Lahabreas Theorie beweisen! Mein Leben für die Schöpfung! Erscheine, Quetzalcoatl!
#. fr: J'offre ma vie en échange de la création qui nous sauvera<nbsp>!<br>Quetzalcóatl<nbsp>! Reforge les chaînes d'Archaeotania<nbsp>!
msgctxt "InstanceContentTextData:21705:0:0"
msgid "I offer up my life's energies in the name of noble creation! Come forth, Quetzalcoatl! Tame the frenzy which profanes these halls!"
msgstr "Жертвую жизнью ради благородного творения! Явись, Кецалькоатль! Утихомирь безумие, осквернившее эти чертоги!"

#. ja: 見学者よ、直ちに立ち去れ……！<br>「獣」が檻を破り、構内は危険な創造物の巣窟だ……！
#. de: Fliehe! Die Schöpfungen haben sich losgerissen. Sie sind nicht zu kontrollieren!
#. fr: Évacuez<nbsp>! La bête a rompu ses chaînes et libéré nos créations<nbsp>!<br>Akadaemia Anydre est envahie<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "InstanceContentTextData:21706:0:0"
msgid "You shouldn't be in here! The <i>beast</i> has broken free, and released the other experiments!"
msgstr "Вам здесь не место! <i>Зверь</i> вырвался и выпустил остальных подопытных!"

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 8273 0>の撃破
#. de: <sheet BNpcName 8273 0> bezwingen
#. fr: Vaincre <sheet BNpcName 8273 0>
